	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0302_businessman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だれかと　しりあうことで
よろこびも　かなしみも　うまれます▼
さいしょは　おもしろい　ダジャレも
いつかは……　いえ　なんでもないです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T02:43:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だれかと　知り合うことで
喜びも　悲しみも　生まれます▼
最初は　おもしろい　ダジャレも
いつかは……　いえ　なんでもないです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T02:44:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T02:12:15" />
		</CommentCell>
